				bio: {
					zh: "學歷｜美國杜克大學動物學博士、國立台灣大學動物系學士\n\n研究領域：比較生物力學、功能形態學、仿生科學\n\n研究主題：生物運動學、生物嗅器流體力學、生物附著力學\n\n目前研究計畫：\n1. 鯊魚鼻部的功能形態、流體動力、與被動入流機制研究（科技部，2020）\n2. 鳥禽羽毛之生物物理學研究及仿生應用（教育部高教深耕計畫「鳥禽遺傳資源暨動物生技研究中心」子計畫九，2018~）\n3. 白蟻彈擊型大顎的材料結構、功能形態、與高速運動之多尺度生物力學研究",
					en: "Education | Ph.D. in Zoology, Duke University; B.S. in Zoology, National Taiwan University\n\nResearch fields: comparative biomechanics, functional morphology, biomimetic science\n\nResearch topics: animal kinematics, olfactory fluid dynamics, biological adhesion mechanics\n\nCurrent research projects:\n1. Functional morphology, fluid dynamics and passive inflow mechanisms of the shark nose (Ministry of Science and Technology, 2020)\n2. Biophysical study and biomimetic applications of bird feathers (Sub-project 9 of the Ministry of Education Higher Education Sprout Project “Avian Genetic Resources and Animal Biotechnology Research Center”, 2018–)\n3. Multiscale biomechanical study of the material structure, functional morphology and high-speed motion of the termite snapping mandible"
