			},
			{
				name: "徐偉婷",
				title: { zh: "科學，從一個想解決的問題開始", en: "Science Begins with a Problem You Want to Solve" },
				bio: {
					zh: "對我而言，走進科學研究並不是一條預先規劃好的路。從動物科學研究所畢業後，我選擇進入畜牧產業，也在第一線看見許多等待被解決的挑戰。這段經歷讓我萌生了一個想法：與其等待答案，能不能用自己的專業創造新的可能？於是，我帶著從產業累積的觀察重新回到學術領域，在中央研究院投入病毒與分子生物學研究，並於博士期間運用基因工程技術開發新型疫苗。然而，研究成果並不是終點，我更希望它能真正回應當初看見的需求。這份期待帶著我走向生技創業，推動技術從實驗室走向應用，並獲得「創業大聯盟競賽」總統獎肯定。一路走來，我相信科學的價值，不只是探索未知，更是從真實世界發現問題，再用科學尋找答案，最後把答案帶回需要它的地方。",
					en: "For me, entering scientific research was not a path planned in advance. After graduating from a graduate institute of animal science, I chose to enter the livestock industry, where I saw, on the front line, many challenges waiting to be solved. That experience gave me an idea: instead of waiting for answers, could I use my own expertise to create new possibilities? So I brought the observations I had gathered in industry back to academia, did research on viruses and molecular biology at Academia Sinica, and during my Ph.D. used genetic engineering to develop a new type of vaccine. But research results are not the end point; I wanted them to truly respond to the needs I had first seen. That aspiration led me into biotech entrepreneurship, moving technology from the laboratory toward application, and earning the Presidential Award at the Startup Alliance Competition (創業大聯盟競賽). Along the way, I have come to believe that the value of science lies not only in exploring the unknown, but in discovering problems in the real world, using science to find answers, and bringing those answers back to where they are needed."
				},
